      "writtenOn": "2026-08-07T18:06:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In get_trace2_target() added a block:\n\n```\n    if os.path.isdir(target):\n        try:\n            with tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile(\n                dir\u003dtarget,\n                prefix\u003df\"repohooks-P{os.getpid():08x}-\",\n                delete\u003dFalse,\n            ) as fp:\n                return fp.name\n        except OSError:\n            return None\n```",
